[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]       "brief": "Map the competitive and operating landscape in Singapore, Thailand, and Indonesia. Identify major local, regional, and global alternative-protein competitors; benchmark products and pricing against conventional meat; and assess retail, e-commerce, foodservice, distributor, and quick-service restaurant channels. Compare regulatory pathways and hurdles relevant to importing, labeling, food safety, claims, certifications, and local manufacturing or sourcing.",
[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]       "must_cover": [
[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]         "Key regional and international players, representative products, market positioning, and competitive advantages",
[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]         "Country-specific pricing benchmarks and plant-based versus conventional meat price premiums",
