[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]       "must_cover": [
[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]         "Recommended country-entry sequence and rationale tied to demand, competition, regulation, and operating feasibility",
[6847465956a0f6376a605391:parallel_evidence]         "Comparison and recommended mix of DTC, B2B partnerships, retail/distributors, foodservice, and QSR channels",
